        "number": 329,
        "title": "Add a static durability lint (QC001-QC006) to workflow validate",
        "url": "https://github.com/octo-org/quiet-choir/pull/329",
        "body": "Closes #154.\n\nPart of #99.\n\nWorkflow bodies are replayed, so code that reads the clock, discards an effect's promise, races effects, or reuses an effect ID in a loop behaves differently on resume than on the first run. Until now only runtime guards caught some of this, and only after a run had started. This adds a static lint that finds these hazards before import, using the type check's own `ts.P\n...",
